sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (Ada)
    participant R1 as review-service pod 1
    participant R2 as review-service pod 2
    participant C as Cassandra
    B->>R1: POST review
    R1->>C: INSERT review_guard … IF NOT EXISTS → applied
    Note over R1: pod dies before append
    B->>R2: POST review (retry)
    R2->>C: INSERT review_guard … IF NOT EXISTS → not applied, counted=false (the first review)
    R2->>C: append the first review · flip counted · increment counters
    R2-->>B: 201 the original review
